    "detailed_description": "Explore the world of Nerdstan in this Beautiful 2D Adventure.<br>Filled with Unique and beautiful challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439810/extras/b2adb0347b14c4bd7bb896bd9ef7bab8.poster.avif?t=1754631643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439810/extras/b2adb0347b14c4bd7bb896bd9ef7bab8.webm?t=1754631643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439810/extras/b2adb0347b14c4bd7bb896bd9ef7bab8.mp4?t=1754631643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Aid Nerdstan Through Different Environments on his Adventures to stop the Glitch and bring peace to the NerdDom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439810/extras/98d659912c0d0516b4e7d9760bde3102.poster.avif?t=1754631643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439810/extras/98d659912c0d0516b4e7d9760bde3102.webm?t=1754631643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439810/extras/98d659912c0d0516b4e7d9760bde3102.mp4?t=1754631643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Encounter, engage and ultimately vanquish a diverse array of fantastical and formidable creatures and Bosses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439810/extras/fdaef39c950b29fa102a67ad09932233.poster.avif?t=1754631643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439810/extras/fdaef39c950b29fa102a67ad09932233.webm?t=1754631643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439810/extras/fdaef39c950b29fa102a67ad09932233.mp4?t=1754631643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Embark on an artful adventure that combines different art styles, from charming pixel art to Symphonic Digital Painting, creating a visually mesmerizing experience like no other.",
